ks up to 2 times, lasts 1 turn.)"}}],"debateSouls":[{"id":"1003305","name":{"zh":"大局为重","en":"Big Picture"},"level":"2","description2":{"zh":"使用恢复牌和特殊牌时可以多选一个目标","en":"When using Recovery Cards and Special Cards, you can choose 1 additional target"}}],"soulPoints":{"war":4000,"battle":4000,"debate":5900},"equipment":[{"id":"WP10014","name":{"zh":"长剑","en":"Longsword"},"level":"1","description":{"zh":"流传最久、随处可见的经典款式。","en":"The most enduring and ubiquitous classic design."},"atkVal":"5","price":"2000","slot":{"zh":"武器","en":"Weapon"}},{"id":"WP1009605","name":{"zh":"山纹将军铠·甲","en":"Mountain-Pattern General Armor - I"},"level":"2","description":{"zh":"在山纹甲基础上增添了披风和吞肩兽，多为统军者、统领者所穿戴。","en":"Mountain-pattern armor enhanced with a cloak and beast-head pauldrons, typically worn by army commanders and leaders."},"defenceVal":"12","price":"9000","slot":{"zh":"护甲","en":"Armor"}},{"id":"WP1023805","name":{"zh":"屋山帻","en":"Ridge Cap"},"level":"1","description":{"zh":"形似房屋顶端的头帻，由两侧的绳带固定。","en":"A headcloth shaped like a roof ridge, secured by ties on both sides."},"defenceVal":"2","hp":"400","price":"2200","slot":{"zh":"头盔","en":"Helmet"}}],"family":{"children":{"label":{"zh":"子女","en":"Children"},"people":[{"id":"WJ1036815","code":"100"}]}},"clans":[{"id":"GI102215","name":{"zh":"京兆杜氏","en":"The Du clan of Jingzhao"},"years":["0","999"],"desc":{"zh":"出自祁姓，帝尧之后，周封唐杜氏，后裔以杜为氏，经杜延年定居杜陵而正式形成，京兆郡名门。杜畿为曹魏名臣，杜恕著《体论》，杜预为西晋名将、经学家，诗圣杜甫为其十三世孙。该家族历经汉、魏、晋、唐千年发展，在政治、军事、文学等领域人才辈出，唐代时更与韦氏并称“城南韦杜，去天尺五”。","en":"Descended from the Qi surname as scions of Emperor Yao, they were enfeoffed as the Tang Du clan during the Zhou dynasty, and their descendants adopted Du as their surname. The lineage formally coalesced after Du Yannian settled in Duling, becoming an illustrious clan of Jingzhao Commandery. Du Ji was a celebrated minister of Cao Wei, Du Shu authored the ‘Ti Lun’, and Du Yu was a famous general and Confucian classicist of the Western Jin, with the Sage of Poetry, Du Fu, being his thirteenth-generation descendant. This Family flourished over a thousand years through the Han, Wei, Jin, and Tang dynasties, producing exceptional figures in politics, military affairs, and literature, and was celebrated in the Tang dynasty alongside the Wei clan: ‘The Wei and Du to the South of the city reach within a foot of heaven.’"},"talent":{"military":"7","commerce":"6","politics":"8"}}],"friendGroups":[],"body":null,"honorifics":[],"selfAddress":[],"specialNames":[[["WJ10346","WJ10241","预儿"],["WJ10346","WJ10241","預兒"],["WJ10346","WJ10241","Yu'er"],["WJ10346","WJ10241","預よ"],["WJ10346","WJ10241","예야"]]],"vip":{"isVIP":0,"from":"0","to":"0"},"marriage":{"aiMarriageAge":"25","startPregnantAge":"0"},"scenarios":[{"story":{"id":"S10802","name":{"zh":"黄巾起义","en":"Yellow Turban Rebellion"},"year":"184","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1030","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[64,34,77,89,57,74],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1009605","helmet":"WP1023805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10215","name":{"zh":"汉末三杰","en":"Three Heroes of the Late Han"},"year":"185","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1030","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[64,34,77,89,57,74],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1009605","helmet":"WP1023805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10615","name":{"zh":"十常侍之乱","en":"Turmoil of the Ten Attendants"},"year":"188","month":"11"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1028","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[64,34,77,89,57,74],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1009605","helmet":"WP1023805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10402","name":{"zh":"诸侯讨董","en":"Coalition Against Dong Zhuo"},"year":"190","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1028","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[64,34,77,8